{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　　\nこんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨夜、『油を注せ！』のMVが公開されました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1BXT9EXHM3CSY6C50MYQJK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1BXV93P9E9PW1VR85QT79C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがでしたでしょうか…？😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーからもらった\nたくさんの温かい空気と言葉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督を始めとした制作に携わって下さった多くのスタッフの皆様からもらった\n熱い想いと、激励と、\nこの作品に込める色んな意味と愛情"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部ぜんぶ噛み締めながら\n最後まで出来る限りの力を出そうと\n努めました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊っていて\n勝手に涙が出てくる時もあったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊っていて\n生きててこれ以上楽しい時間はないと思える時もありました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知らなかった色んな気持ちを\nこの作品に教えてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"櫻坂46として\n新しいMVだと思ってもらえたなら\nとっても嬉しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかたくさんの人に届いて欲しいです\n何度も、何度でも観てください…！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddiesの皆様\n本当にいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までと同じように\nどうか『油を注せ！』MVも\n愛してください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします…！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1BXWFBY15MAMBZAT4FG4D9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1BXXKQSH1HGJFCQK5TS2FM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">